  "note": [
   "These statistics apply the regional division of 1 January 2026 to the whole time series.",
   "In 2025, the statistical system of household-dwelling units and housing conditions was reformed. The revision have some impact on statistical data from 2025 and on time series changes from 2024 to 2025.\r\nIn the data for 2020, the compilation of statistics on tenure status was revised especially as concerns dwellings owned by rental housing companies.\r\nIn 2014 the compilation of statistics on tenure status was revised especially as concerns unknown dwellings.",
   "Data for annexed municipalities have been combined. An exception the sub-area of Längelmäki annexing into Orivesi and Jämsä since year 2006: The entire population of Längelmäki has been combined with Jämsä during years 1985-2005. The data are therefore not comparable in the time series in all respects with the regions of Pirkanmaa and Central Finland and as well as for the municipalities of Jämsä and Orivesi.\r\nOn 1 January 2009, an area of 29.1 km2 belonging to the municipality of Sipoo was merged with Helsinki. As a result of this change, the municipal boundary between Helsinki and Sipoo and the boundary between the sub-regional units of Helsinki and Porvoo changed. The data are therefore not comparable in the time series in all respects with the sub-regional units of Porvoo and Helsinki and the municipalities of Sipoo and Helsinki.",
   "<A HREF='https://stat.fi/en/statistics/documentation/asku' TARGET=_blank>Documentation of statistics</A>",
   "15gq -- Household-dwelling units and dwelling population by region, tenure status and housing density, 2005-2025, Household-dwelling units and housing conditions, Statistics Finland"
